    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Champions of Faith",
    "summary": "In your Command phase, pick up to three of your ADEPTA SORORITAS units. Units aboard TRANSPORTS can be picked. The Righteous designation expires when your next Command phase begins. While Righteous, their models gain 1 inch of Move and improve Leadership by 1. The weapons of certain Righteous models improve both skill ratings by 1, for shooting and melee alike. Eligible models are PARAGON WARSUITS or members of a BATTLE SISTERS SQUAD. Both Celestian types qualify, CELESTIAN SACRESANTS and CELESTIAN INSIDIANTS.",
